@startuml Sequence

actor User
participant CoolManagerApp
participant Refrigerator

User -> CoolManagerApp: Initiate power-on request
CoolManagerApp -> Refrigerator: Check status
Refrigerator -> CoolManagerApp: Status (Off)
CoolManagerApp -> Refrigerator: Send power-on command
Refrigerator -> CoolManagerApp: Confirmation
CoolManagerApp -> User: Refrigerator turned on

@enduml